  "description": "CO-03 step 1: the exact B08 read-face envelope law as a contract. status is the CLOSED seven-value truth vocabulary {OK, UNAVAILABLE, NOT_IMPLEMENTED, TOOL_TIMEOUT, NOT_MEASURABLE, STALE, NOT_ATTESTED}; an unavailable read is UNAVAILABLE, an unattested claim is NOT_ATTESTED — never a fabricated OK. Registered by CO-03 (TRIAD-ORIGIN-V7-CHANGE-ORDERS-2026-08-12) as an additive major. Registration activates no producer and grants no authority; posture unchanged OFF/OFF/OFF/LIVE, DENIED_SAFE_HOLD.",
